<li class="break-words">Ensure <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">js/vendor/</span> contains <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">three.min.js</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">OrbitControls.js</span> (from <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">examples/js/controls/</span>), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">codemirror.min.js</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">codemirror.css</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">vim.min.js</span>.</li>
<li class="break-words">Generate sounds: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">python generate_assets.py</span>.</li>
<li class="break-words">Save the provided <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">index.html</span>.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Local Test</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Start server: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">python -m http.server 8000</span>.</li>
<li class="break-words">Open <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">http://localhost:8000</span> in Chrome or Firefox.</li>
<li class="break-words">Open DevTools (F12 &gt; Console) for logs:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">â€œInitializing sceneâ€, â€œRenderer initializedâ€, â€œOrbitControls initializedâ€, â€œStar field addedâ€, â€œLevel X addedâ€¦â€, â€œDust particles addedâ€, â€œCamera at (0, 0, 10)â€.</li>
<li class="break-words">Key presses, level selections, task completions.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Expected Visuals</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Dark blue background.</li>
<li class="break-words">White star field (10,000 points).</li>
<li class="break-words">12 level spheres in a spiral (green for level 0, orange for others).</li>
<li class="break-words">Gray dust particles moving toward the camera.</li>
<li class="break-words">Yellow triangles around nearby levels (&lt;5 units).</li>
<li class="break-words">Yellow halo and â€œType i to initiateâ€¦â€ message when a level is centered and unlocked.</li>
