 class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">n</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">N</span> for next track, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">b</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">B</span> for previous track, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">s</span> for play/pause) must work reliably. Iâ€™ll provide an updated <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">index.html</span> that fixes these issues while maintaining the intuitive design where each planet represents a track from <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">js/playlist.js</span>. The Vim minigame logic remains commented out (toggleable with <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">ENABLE_VIM_MINIGAME</span>), and all other features (spiral galaxy, flight controls, triangles/halo, mode buttons, and sound effects) are preserved.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" class="text-xl">Key Changes</h3>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Fix Planet Display</strong>: Ensure 12 planets always appear in the spiral galaxy, each tied to a track from <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">playlistFiles</span> (cycling if fewer tracks than planets). Log <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">playlistFiles</span> to confirm loading.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Track Colors</strong>: Planets are colored:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Green (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">0x00FF00</span>) for the currently playing track.</li>
<li class="break-words">Red (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">0xFF0000</span>) for unplayed tracks.</li>
<li class="break-words">Blue (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">0x0000FF</span>) for previously played tracks.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Playlist Controls</strong>: Fix <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">n</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">N</span> (next track), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">b</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">B</span> (previous track), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">s</span> (play/pause), and ensure <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p</span> toggles the playlist viewer reliably. <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Escape</span> exits Playlist Mode to Flight Mode.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Playlist Viewer</strong>: Shows all tracks with <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">â–º</span> for the current track, updated on track changes.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Halo Fix</strong>: Ensure the yellow halo and "Type i to initiate..." message appear when an unlocked planet is centered (&lt;5 units).</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Mode Switching</strong>: Retain <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">f</span> (Flight Mode), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">i</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">space</span> (Insert Mode, selects planet and plays track), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p</span> (Playlist Mode), with <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Escape</span> to Flight Mode.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Commented Vim Minigame</strong>: Keep bubble shooter and Vim puzzles commented out, toggleable via <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">ENABLE_VIM_MINIGAME</span>.</li>
</ul>
