ot(.not-prose):hover]:text-primary [&amp;_a:not(.not-prose):hover]:decoration-primary [&amp;_a:not(.not-prose)]:underline [&amp;_a:not(.not-prose)]:decoration-primary/30 [&amp;_a:not(.not-prose)]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_h2:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_h3:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_h4:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">To address your request, Iâ€™ll update the provided <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">index.html</span> to add an "About" button in the bottom right corner of the screen, which opens a pop-up when pressed with the <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">/</span> or <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">?</span> key or clicked. The pop-up will display the message: "This page is open source, edit it here: <a href="https://github.com/standardgalactic/userland/blob/main/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://github.com/standardgalactic/userland/blob/main/index.html</a>". Iâ€™ll also ensure all existing functionality remains intact, including:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">12 planets in a spiral galaxy, each tied to a track from <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">js/playlist.js</span>.</li>
