<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Mode Buttons</strong>: Click â€œFlight Mode (f)â€, â€œInsert Mode (i/space)â€, â€œPlaylist Mode (p)â€, â€œAbout (/ or ?)â€.</li>
