t(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_h3:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_h4:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">I apologize for the previous attempt breaking the planet display. The issue likely stemmed from missing playlist integration and track association with planets. To address your request, Iâ€™ll minimally modify your provided working <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">index.html</span> to add:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">An <strong class="font-semibold">About button</strong> in the bottom right corner, toggled by <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">/</span> or <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">?</span>, displaying a pop-up with the message: "This page is open source, edit it here: <a href="https://github.com/standardgalactic/userland/blob/main/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">https://github.com/standardgalactic/userland/blob/main/index.html</a>".</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Planets tied to tracks</strong> from <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">js/playlist.js</span>, with colors: green (current track), red (unplayed), blue (played).</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Playlist controls</strong>: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">s</span> (play/pause), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">n</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">N</span> (next track), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">b</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">B</span> (previous track), with <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p</span> toggling the playlist viewer and <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Escape</span> returning to Flight Mode.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Mobile compatibility</strong>: Adjust styles for smaller screens and add touch controls for navigation and mode switching.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Minimal changes</strong>: Preserve the spiral galaxy, Vim minigames, flight controls, and existing UI, ensuring planets remain visible and functional.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto" class="text-xl">Changes</h3>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">About Button/Pop-up</strong>: Add a button in the bottom right and a centered pop-up, styled like the playlist, toggled by <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">/</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">?</span>, or clicking, closed with <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Escape</span>.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Planet-Track Association</strong>: Each of the 12 planets is tied to a track from <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">playlistFiles</span>, cycling if fewer tracks exist. Colors reflect track status (green/red/blue).</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Playlist Controls</strong>: Fix <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">n</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">N</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">b</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">B</span> to navigate tracks correctly, add <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">s</span> for play/pause, ensure <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p</span> and <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Escape</span> work reliably.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Mobile Support</strong>: Use responsive CSS (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">vw</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">vh</span> units, media queries) and add touch controls via <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">OrbitControls</span> touch support and tap events for buttons.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Debugging</strong>: Add logging to confirm playlist loading and track changes.</li>
</ul>
