<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Enter Insert Mode</strong>: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">i</span> or <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">space</span> (keyboard); tap â€œInsert Modeâ€ button (mobile).</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Enter Playlist Mode</strong>: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p</span> (keyboard); tap â€œPlaylist Modeâ€ button (mobile).</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Enter About Mode</strong>: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">/</span> or <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">?</span> (keyboard); tap â€œAboutâ€ button (mobile).</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Return to Flight Mode</strong>: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">f</span> or <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Escape</span> (keyboard); tap â€œFlight Modeâ€ button (mobile).</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Playlist Mode</strong>: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">s</span> (play/pause), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">n</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">N</span> (next track), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">b</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">B</span> (previous track); tap â€œPlay/Pauseâ€, â€œPreviousâ€, â€œNextâ€ buttons.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Minigames</strong>: For levels 0, 3, 6, 9 (maze), 2, 4, 8, 10, 11 (doubling), 1, 5, 7 (Vim puzzle), use commands like <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">dd</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">yy p</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">fire</span>.</li>
</ul>
