t(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_h3:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_h4:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">I apologize for the confusion caused by the previous attempts. The issue with your provided code is that the About mode implementation is incomplete and conflicts with the existing playlist and input handling logic. Specifically:</p>
