<li class="break-words">Yellow halo and â€œType i to initiateâ€¦â€ when an unlocked planet is centered.</li>
<li class="break-words">Playlist pop-up with track list (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p</span> to toggle, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">n</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">b</span> to navigate, same as working version).</li>
