<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Expected Behavior</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Visuals</strong>: Dark blue background, white star field (10,000 points), drifting dust particles, 12 planets in a spiral (green for current, orange for locked, blue for completed), yellow triangles around nearby planets (&lt;5 units), yellow halo and â€œType i to initiateâ€¦â€ when an unlocked planet is centered.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Sound</strong>: Background music plays on keypress/click, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">pop.wav</span> on bubble pop, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">level_complete.wav</span> on level completion, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">error.wav</span> on invalid input.</li>
