</li>
<li class="break-words">Open <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">http://localhost:8000</span> on a mobile device (e.g., iPhone/Android) or desktop browser with DevTools in mobile view (e.g., Chrome: F12 &gt; Toggle Device Toolbar).</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Clear Browser Cache</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Chrome: F12 &gt; Network &gt; Check â€œDisable cacheâ€ &gt; Reload.</li>
<li class="break-words">Firefox: Ctrl+Shift+Delete &gt; Clear cache &gt; Reload.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words">Check Console (F12 &gt; Console):
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">[diag] tracks loaded: ["playlist/01%20-%20The%20Abyss%20Within.mp3", ...]</span>.</li>
<li class="break-words"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">[diag] THREE: object | OrbitControls: function | playlistFiles: [...]</span>.</li>
<li class="break-words">â€œTrack selected: [track name] (index X)â€ on tap.</li>
<li class="break-words">â€œInitializing sceneâ€, â€œRenderer initializedâ€, etc.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Network Tab</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Confirm <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">js/playlist.js</span> and <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">playlist/01%20-%20The%20Abyss%20Within.mp3</span> return 200 OK.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Verify</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Playlist</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Tap <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Playlist Mode (p)</span> button or press <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p</span> to open playlist.</li>
<li class="break-words">Tap a track (e.g., â€œ01 - The Abyss Within.mp3â€) to play it; <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">â–º</span> moves to the tapped track, and it plays.</li>
<li class="break-words"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">n</span> advances, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">b</span> goes back.</li>
<li class="break-words"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p</span> or <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Escape</span> toggles playlist (open/close).</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">About Mode</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Tap <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">About (/ or ?)</span> button or press <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">/</span>/<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">?</span> to toggle About pop-up.</li>
<li class="break-words"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Escape</span> closes.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Visuals</strong>: Star field, 12 planets (green/orange/blue), dust particles, yellow triangles/halo.</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Controls</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Desktop: <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">w</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">s</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">a</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">d</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">r</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">f</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">q</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">e</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">j</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">k</span>, <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">;</span> for navigation.</li>
<li class="break-words">Mobile: Use OrbitControls (drag to rotate, pinch to zoom).</li>
<li class="break-words"><span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">i</span> or <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">space</span> for Insert Mode (minigames: maze, doubling, Vim puzzle).</li>
<li class="break-words">Buttons at <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">left: 20%</span> (Flight), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">40%</span> (Insert), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">60%</span> (Playlist), <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">right: 10px</span> (About).</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Mobile Testing</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">On a mobile device, access <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">http://[your-local-ip]:8000</span> (find IP with <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">ifconfig</span> or <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">ip addr</span>).</li>
<li class="break-words">Open playlist (<span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">Playlist Mode</span> button or <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">p</span> if keyboard available).</li>
<li class="break-words">Tap tracks to select; confirm playback and <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">â–º</span> update.</li>
<li class="break-words">Test button taps and pinch/drag for navigation.</li>
<li class="break-words">Check Console via remote debugging (e.g., Chrome DevTools via USB).</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Debugging</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words"><strong class="font-semibold">Tap Not Working</strong>:
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Verify <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">#playlist-container p</span> elements have <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">cursor: pointer</span> (DevTools &gt; Elements).</li>
<li class="break-words">Check Console for â€œTrack selectedâ€ logs or â€œAudio play blockedâ€.</li>
<li class="break-words">Log <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">tracks</span> and <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">backgroundSound</span>:
